  "description": "What the COT data shows and where I’m deploying capital next",
  "body_html": "<p>A quick stock market game plan to prepare you ahead of time…I use foresight, not hindsight here. </p><p>When I shared with you on <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/commodity-to-run-124?r=4z8lgl\">March 13<sup>th</sup>, 2025, silver would run over 124%</a></strong>, in which silver has well surpassed that estimate, one of the key variables for the run was banks being squeezed. Not the only variable, but a key variable. </p><p>Now ask yourself, do you think banks are just sitting there taking it? They are not planning for the longer term? Unlikely. </p><p>Interestingly, Commercials have actually increased their net silver short positions since January 2025 from the CFTC COTS reports of today<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a>. We don’t know which bank is doing what, but we can see their overall “sentiment”. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png\" width=\"668\" height=\"324\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:324,&quot;width&quot;:668,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:55132,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/185844929?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZKa6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F04fd8e25-b096-40ee-9c3d-447c5f3235a4_668x324.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>While retail investors continue their circle jerk…just as they did with Gamestop (and most lost in the end)…the majority of commercials are planning for further down the road. Will a few banks potentially “bust”? Maybe. But certainly not all of them. They have more than enough money to stay alive…not to mention, their good ol’ pal, the U.S. Government will come and save them. </p><p>What does this all mean? <em><strong>Silver’s rally will not last forever</strong></em>…just like Gamestop. I am not saying it will go to $0 in a doom and gloom call. What I am saying, is Gamestop has largely went sideways, stagnant for more than 6 years now. Only some temporary rallies. Thats how I envision silver to behave. The super long term holders (decades), which is not the majority of people, will still remain up. </p><h4><strong>The primary point: I expect silver, in the long term, to either go down, or stagnate…and banks are positioning for that as indicated by the CFTC COTS report. The first break in price action and trend, I will sell off and shift heavier to legacy finance. </strong></h4><p>You need to be subscribed to get those timely alerts:</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"991\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:991,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:431218,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/185844929?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hVSh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa066e02c-0901-4c68-8d55-9046e1f4858d_2600x1770.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">After most retail bought, Gamestop went sideways and down. For some buyers that was a -91% loss.</figcaption></figure></div><p>Now…just like you got a heads up about silver back in early 2025, this is a early heads up about legacy finance stocks.</p><p>When silver, gold and many precious metals begin to stall out, my speculation is that is when banks will begin to see positive price action. Of course they have many positions…not just silver. But if you haven’t seen, I showed how legacy banks, very quietly have been crushing earnings, and have some of the best macro chart setups I have see in a few years. You can review those stocks and sector in: </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">ETF Research Article</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/going-shopping-3-finance-stocks-im?r=4z8lgl\">3 Stocks I Bought This Week</a></p></li></ul><p>The positions are already starting to do well, and we are still early. </p><h4>Additionally, another alert went off on my macro alert notifications. This afternoon I will be buying: </h4>",
